WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.998
Step 1. Open the account page. The account must have the Status Active.

2.1
00:00:05.998 --> 00:00:12.012
Step 2. Select Settle and Close. Care opens the Close Account dialog.

3.1
00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:12.804
Step 3.

3.2
00:00:12.804 --> 00:00:19.238
Care selects Closed Completed if the Amount Due is zero, otherwise Closed Bad Debt.

3.3
00:00:19.238 --> 00:00:21.830
Keep it, or select another.

4.1
00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:27.579
Step 4. Read the warnings. They do not stop you from closing the account.

5.1
00:00:27.579 --> 00:00:30.068
Step 5. Select Close Account.

5.2
00:00:30.068 --> 00:00:34.813
Care sets the Status to Inactive and sets the end date.
